### Ticket API - manual requests
### Requires: docker compose up -d (Postgres + Keycloak), and ticket-service running on :8081
### Note: IntelliJ's HTTP Client "run" button is an Ultimate-only feature - in Community
### edition this file is documentation you copy from, not a click-to-run file. See
### scripts/test-ticket-api.ps1 at the repo root for a script you can actually execute.

### 1. Get a token for the test customer
POST http://localhost:8080/realms/helpdesk/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=helpdesk-frontend&grant_type=password&username=test-customer&password=customer-local-dev-123

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.access_token);
%}

### 2. Create a ticket
POST http://localhost:8081/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Can't log in",
  "description": "Password reset email never arrives",
  "category": "ACCESS"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("ticketId", response.body.id);
%}

### 3. Get the ticket by id
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. List tickets (paginated)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tickets?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Update subject/description
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Can't log in - still broken",
  "description": "Tried again, still no email"
}

### 6. Legal status change: OPEN -> AI_TRIAGED
PATCH http://localhost:8081/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "AI_TRIAGED"
}

### 7. Illegal status change: AI_TRIAGED -> RESOLVED (expect 409)
PATCH http://localhost:8081/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "RESOLVED"
}

### 8. No token (expect 401)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tickets

### 9. Invalid body - blank subject (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "",
  "description": "x",
  "category": "ACCESS"
}

### 10. Unknown id (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/tickets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
